      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient with a pseudoaneurysm at the site of the distal anastomosis of a saphenous vein coronary bypass graft is described. The aneurysm was resected. To our knowledge this is the first report of this complication after coronary bypass surgery."},
